{"id": "34193", "title": "暴躁狂郎(再见王朝4)", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34193/34193s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34193.htm", "intro": "望着躺在床上鬼吼鬼叫、自称是他英文老师的女人，他已气得全身细胞蓄势待发想揍人了，他兄弟不知打哪找来个另类老师教他英文，开玩笑！既是“沙堡”的堡主又是保全公司董事长。就算认不得几个英文字也没什么大不了啊！为了让她死心自动求去，他卯起来戏弄她：泼她一桶水，她指着他鼻子说要尊师重道。不给她饭吃，她跑去偷摘他的菜充饥。他耐心已至临界点，更令他捉狂的事却又发生……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34193", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2172689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2172690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2172691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2172692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2172693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2172694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2172695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2172696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2172697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2172698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2172699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2172700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2172701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2172702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2172703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2172704.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2172705.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2172706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2172707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2172708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2172709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2172710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2172711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2172712.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2172713.h